            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj parametry, aby kod wyświetlał <code>PeterPiperPicked</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"mix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first + second + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = mix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Peter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Piper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"PeterPiperPicked\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>first</code>, następnie <code>,</code>, a potem <code>second</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możesz dodać więcej parametrów, oddzielając ich nazwy przecinkami.</p><p>Dodaj trzy parametry w odpowiedniej kolejności, aby funkcja połączyła słowa w <code>PeterPiperPicked</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"mix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first + second + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = mix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Peter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Piper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fourth\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"PeterPiperPicked\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>first</code>, następnie <code>,</code>, <code>second</code>, <code>,</code> i na końcu <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
